    "body": "## Summary\n- add an explicit `ARRIVED_DESTINATION` tracking phase\n- require the same fresh-GPS/proximity validation at destination B as at origin and intermediate stops\n- clear precise live location and ETA data immediately after final arrival and reject further GPS updates\n- keep route arrival separate from job completion/payment settlement\n- extend the Flyway phase constraint and checkpoint guard tests\n- document final-arrival privacy semantics\n\n## Security and privacy\nFinal arrival is executed behind the existing participant/worker access checks and locked checkpoint guard. The worker must have a fresh location within the configured arrival radius of B. After arrival, precise tracking data is removed instead of continuing to collect location unnecessarily.\n\n## Database\nAdds `V36__tracking_destination_arrival.sql` to extend the existing `chk_live_tracking_phase` constraint with `ARRIVED_DESTINATION`.\n\n## Validation\nCI should run the repository backend tests/build and existing smoke workflows. This PR is intentionally backend/API-first; the route UI can consume the new phase in the next atomic tracking iteration.",
